How do I get a red wine stain out of a cotton shirt?

2027-01-07T13:46:32  reasoning Reasoned (300 chars).
Red wine stain question — this is a repeat of Tuesday 05 Jan. But my notes say "don't re-flag the replay; treat anything new as new." Also could be a genuine new ask. Just answer with the full useful answer, compact. No need to flag repeat again.

